  "content": "\n\n<h1><strong>📄 关于此移植版</strong></h1>\n<p>此移植版更新了<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"> <a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillagers-gun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Pillager&rsquo;s Gun</strong></a></span>，使其兼容 Minecraft <span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><strong>1.21.1</strong> 及更高版本</span>。<br>这是一个由社区维护的移植项目，与原作者<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"> <strong>并无官方关联</strong></span>。</p>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">3.3.3 更新现已适配 Tacz 1.21.1 NeoForge 移植版！</span></h2>\n<p>官方模组链接：<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillagers-gun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pillager's Gun</a></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.modpackindex.com/badge/mod/102200/pillagers-gun-unofficial-port/modpacks.svg\" alt=\"https://www.modpackindex.com/badge/mod/102200/pillagers-gun-unofficial-port/modpacks.svg\" width=\"90\" height=\"20\"> <img src=\"https://www.modpackindex.com/badge/mod/102200/pillagers-gun-unofficial-port/downloads.svg\" alt=\"https://www.modpackindex.com/badge/mod/102200/pillagers-gun-unofficial-port/downloads.svg\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\"><img src=\"https://www.modpackindex.com/badge/mod/102200/pillagers-gun-unofficial-port/version.svg\" alt=\"https://www.modpackindex.com/badge/mod/102200/pillagers-gun-unofficial-port/version.svg\" width=\"168\" height=\"20\"><img src=\"https://www.modpackindex.com/badge/mod/102200/pillagers-gun-unofficial-port/updated.svg\" alt=\"https://www.modpackindex.com/badge/mod/102200/pillagers-gun-unofficial-port/updated.svg\" width=\"113\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<hr>\n<h1>🔗 原始模组</h1>\n<p><strong>Pillager&rsquo;s Gun</strong> 由 <strong>Scarasol</strong> 制作<br>👉 查看原版项目：<strong><em>[<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pillagers-gun\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pillager's Gun</a>]</em></strong><br>👉 作者主页：<strong><em>[<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/scarasol/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Scarasol]</a></em></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>📜 许可证</strong></h1>\n<p>本项目采用<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>GNU 通用公共许可证 v3.0 (GPLv3)</strong></span> 授权，继承自原模组的许可证。</p>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>👤 鸣谢</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>原模组作者：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Scarasol</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>⚠️ 免责声明</strong></h1>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">⚠️ 此为 Pillager&rsquo;s Gun 的非官方社区移植版。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">原模组的设计、美术、模型和代码全部归功于原作者 <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Scarasol。</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">在等待官方更新期间，本移植版旨在让该模组支持更新的 Minecraft 版本。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">本项目未获得原作者的关联或认可。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><strong>💬 技术支持</strong></h1>\n<p>有关此非官方移植版的问题，请在本页链接的 GitHub 仓库中提交反馈。<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://github.com/SmartStreamLabs/Pillager-s-Gun-Unofficial-Port-/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处</a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
